            "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist our new 3D evolution adventure!</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>*DISCLAIMER: Discard your expectations. It's barely a game. It's more like an interactive wallpaper, really. XD<br><br>An ambient, very simple game* with pseudo-puzzle elements, something you can leave open on a second monitor while you work.<br><br>Experience this peaceful world through the eyes of a sentient pillowcase. Navigate dreamscapes and curious events best experienced, but not dwelt upon too much. After all, a dream is just a dream, right?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Click on objects to interact with them, press Z to zoom in/out<br></li><li>Alter the dreamscape through interaction chains<br></li><li>Unlock more dreamscapes by opening portals<br></li><li>But most of all, just enjoy. Even if it makes very little sense. ^_^</li></ul>",
