                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]Reverie [/b](Point-n-Click Puzzle)\n\nNo options on this one, just point, click, experiment.  You can hit the 'z' button to zoom in/out, and that's about it!\n\nWhat little sound there is in the game is turned waaaay down, so you'll need to pump up the volume if you want to hear anything.\n\nThis is a very short puzzle game with five chapters.  In each chapter there is a well with four crystals on it.  Hover your cursor over each crystal to see what your tasks for the level are.  Complete the four tasks and move on to the next level.\n\nThere are 21 achievements, all but one of which are tied to completing your tasks, so there is only one that you'll have to work for... and all it requires is [spoiler]having a total game runtime of eight+ hours.[/spoiler]  A little annoying since the game takes no more than 30 minutes to complete, but at least it's not as bad as the achievements in The Stanley Parable! ;D\n\nI had a weird glitch that made our character invisible for levels two to five, but was still able to complete the game with no trouble.\n\nRecommended for those looking for a short, charming puzzle game.",
